Rāma resolves to lodge the host on Suvēla --- Rāma climbs Suvēla with Lakṣmaṇa and Sugrīva and Vibhīṣaṇa --- Monkey chiefs follow in hundreds to the peak --- Monkeys view Laṅkā floating sky high with demon lined walls --- Monkeys roar challenge before Rāma's eyes --- Rāma camps gladly under risen full moon